{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Normalize sampling into the documented half-open interval**\n\nDividing by `0xffffffff` maps the maximum unsigned hash to exactly `1.0`, contradicting `[0,1)` and shifting deterministic boundaries relative to implementations dividing by `2^32`. Use `4294967296.0` as the denominator and add a fixed-vector boundary test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7s0a_k","finding_digest":"e7d59d7f97adf9275b8c6059f365d1f81f01b4bd532c18412ba85b880824af36","finding_id":"arf_v1_47kz274xvx4sow4mmbm7gzor7a","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::shouldsample::unit-interval-normalization","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::shouldsample::unit-interval-normalization","line":478,"observation_digest":"c4c4ef79ebba423b907e9bca7f257544f69de3e6060269b7cee4127fa7a6de61","observation_id":"aro_v1_ytco66plxjbdxed6tpfh6jlvit","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_47kz274xvx4sow4mmbm7gzor7a","published_at":"2026-09-09T21:26:08Z","review_id":"arr_v1_scztmzrchxwvclkurodp4sbyjj","reviewed_base_sha":"479f023a672bf03f84703cde341df7b48c8eb72a","reviewed_head_sha":"7f3bdc4e67fc71884846370ed3fa3b98f5eb4842","reviewer":"codex","start_line":478,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_ricfofxxgz3qma5hpyzpnotqwc","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-09T21:26:08Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
